  "body": "Found in M5's delta review of PR #1522 (pullrequestreview-5898807973), non-blocking. In `crates/motion/src/machining2d/slot_room.rs` `fit()`, the `for _ in 0..2` inscribe loop checks `out > INSCRIBE_MAX * w` on each pass, so in theory the total draw-in can exceed the documented 5% per side (10% of the width). Every case sampled stays inside the face (safe), but the doc and the code disagree.\n\nDone means: the cap is cumulative over the passes (or the doc says per pass), pinned by a face whose two passes together would exceed the cap.",
